{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-verifier/1/output.schema.json",
    "title": "KnowledgeReview.v1 输出结构",
    "summary": "该 JSON Schema 约束独立复核结果：每批包含 1–16 个逐文档 verdict，结论只能是 accepted 或 needs_revision，并可附带问题清单和结构化未决事项。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "batch-verdicts",
        "title": "批次与判定单位",
        "body": "`KnowledgeReview.v1` 的顶层对象固定 `schema_version` 为 1，并要求提供 `verdicts`。批次必须包含 1–16 项，每项用最长 500 字符的 `documentKey` 对应一份草稿；`verdict` 只能取 `accepted` 或 `needs_revision`。[[c1]] 因而该合同表达的是逐文档二元复核结果，不包含评分、部分通过或自动改写正文的字段。"
      },
      {
        "key": "issues-questions",
        "title": "问题与未决事项",
        "body": "每个 verdict 可列最多 30 条、每条最长 1,600 字符的 `issues`。`questions` 最多 20 项，每项必须同时给出问题、原因、下一步、是否阻塞及引用键列表，且禁止额外属性。[[c2]] 顶层和 verdict 同样关闭额外属性并要求关键字段齐全，使宿主可进行严格结构校验；但 schema 只保证形状，不能证明结论在语义上正确。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "复核批次与判定枚举",
        "reason": "支持 schema 版本、批次数量、documentKey 以及两种 verdict 取值的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-verifier/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 27
        },
        "quote": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"schema_version\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"const\": 1\n    },\n    \"verdicts\": {\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"maxItems\": 16,\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\""
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "问题与未决事项字段",
        "reason": "支持 issues 数量和长度，以及 questions 必填结构与约束的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-verifier/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 28,
          "endLine": 78
        },
        "quote": "          \"issues\": {\n            \"maxItems\": 30,\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"minLength\": 1,\n              \"maxLength\": 1600\n            }\n          },\n          \"questions\": {\n            \"maxItems\": 20,\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"it"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "严格必填与顶层合同",
        "reason": "支持 verdict 必填字段、禁止额外属性以及顶层 KnowledgeReview.v1 标识的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-verifier/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 79,
          "endLine": 95
        },
        "quote": "        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"documentKey\",\n          \"verdict\",\n          \"issues\",\n          \"questions\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"schema_version\",\n    \"verdicts\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"$id\": \"https://omem.local/schemas/Kno"
      }
    ],
    "questions": []
  },
